    titleEn: "Chamartín Station to Madrid Airport – Private Transfer",
    titleEs: "Traslado de la Estación de Chamartín al Aeropuerto de Madrid",
    seoTitleEn: "Chamartín Station to Madrid Airport | Private Transfer",
