    distanceKm: 95,
    titleEn: "Madrid to Segovia Day Trip by Private Car",
    titleEs: "Excursión de un Día de Madrid a Segovia en Coche Privado",
    seoTitleEn: "Madrid to Segovia Day Trip | Private Transfer Service",
    seoTitleEs: "Madrid a Segovia en Un Día | Traslado Privado de Excursión",
    metaDescriptionEn: "Private day trip from Madrid to Segovia, about 1 hr 15 min each way. See the Roman aqueduct and Alcázar with a round-trip vehicle waiting all day.",
